WEBVTT

00:52:56.496 --> 00:53:01.746
I mean, do you see a real chance where
something like that could be incorporated

00:53:01.746 --> 00:53:04.996
as a sort of an absolute golden
rule and and if you like,

00:53:04.996 --> 00:53:11.413
spread around the community so that it
seeps into corporations and elsewhere?

00:53:11.413 --> 00:53:14.496
Because that I've seen no
evidence that, well,

00:53:14.496 --> 00:53:17.121
a little corporation that was
potentially a game changer.

00:53:17.204 --> 00:53:20.496
Corporations have this weird
incentive problem. Right.

00:53:21.121 --> 00:53:22.996
What I was trying to speak
about was something that

00:53:22.996 --> 00:53:24.954
I think should be technologically possible
,

00:53:25.163 --> 00:53:27.663
and that's something that we
as a society should demand.

00:53:28.996 --> 00:53:33.413
And I think it is technically possible for
this to be sort of like a layer above